bottomparticipants

actor User
boundary "View Chapter UI" as UI
boundary Router
control ImageChapterController
control ImageChapterService
entity ":ChapterModel" as ChapterModel
database MongoDB

User -> UI: 1. Open chapter detail
activate User
activate UI

UI -> Router: 2. GET /chapter/id/{chapterId}
activate Router

Router -> ImageChapterController: 3. getChapterById(chapterId)
activate ImageChapterController

ImageChapterController -> ImageChapterController: 4. Validate chapterId
activate ImageChapterController
space
deactivate ImageChapterController

opt Invalid chapterId
    ImageChapterController --> Router: 4.1 BadRequestException
    Router --> UI: 4.2 Show error
    UI --> User: 4.3 Error message
end

ImageChapterController -> ImageChapterService: 5. getChapterById(ObjectId)
activate ImageChapterService

ImageChapterService -> ChapterModel: 6. aggregate(match + lookup)
activate ChapterModel
ChapterModel -> MongoDB: 7. aggregate pipeline
activate MongoDB
MongoDB --> ChapterModel: 8. aggregated result
deactivate MongoDB
ChapterModel --> ImageChapterService: 9. result[]
deactivate ChapterModel

ImageChapterService -> ImageChapterService: 10. Check chapter existence
activate ImageChapterService
space
deactivate ImageChapterService

opt Chapter not found
    ImageChapterService --> ImageChapterController: 10.1 null
    ImageChapterController --> Router: 10.2 NotFoundException
    Router --> UI: 10.3 Show error
    UI --> User: 10.4 Chapter not found
end

ImageChapterService --> ImageChapterController: 11. chapter with images
deactivate ImageChapterService

ImageChapterController --> Router: 12. { success: true, data }
deactivate ImageChapterController
Router --> UI: 13. Show chapter data
deactivate Router
UI --> User: 14. View chapter
deactivate UI
deactivate User